# Batchwise Frontend Production Environment Variables

# The base URL of your deployed FastAPI backend API v1 endpoint.
# In local development, defaults to '/api/v1' via the Vite dev proxy.
# In production on Vercel or Netlify, set this to your hosted backend URL:
# Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://batchwise-api.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1

